# Optional operator fork digest for pq-devnet-5 gossip topics
#
# One 8-hex-char line (optional 0x prefix). Leave empty: Ethean uses lstar
# GOSSIP_DIGEST "12345678" (leanSpec), not SHA-256(fork_name). That will not
# match a public mesh until you paste the operator pin (A2).
#
# Also: --fork-digest AABBCCDD  or  ETHEAN_FORK_DIGEST=AABBCCDD
#
# Example (replace with the live run digest; do not invent one):
# aabbccdd
